{"id":"9d793ce06af6eaa6","group":"92","path":"92/92-cor-henkin-provable.md","title":"Henkin Sentence Provable","display":"cor-henkin-provable — Henkin Sentence Provable","type":"corollary","metadata":{"type":"corollary","book":"Gödel's Incompleteness Theorems","book_abbrev":"92","label":"92-cor-henkin-provable","aliases":["92-cor-henkin-provable"],"display":"cor-henkin-provable — Henkin Sentence Provable","depends_on":["[[92-df-henkin-sentence]]","[[92-thm-lob-theorem]]","[[92-df-g-system]]","[[92-df-sentence]]","[[92-df-provability-predicate]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"corollary"},{"key":"book","html":"Gödel's Incompleteness Theorems"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"92"},{"key":"label","html":"92-cor-henkin-provable"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>92-cor-henkin-provable</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"cor-henkin-provable — Henkin Sentence Provable"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"67317965f7ebd660\" href=\"?note=67317965f7ebd660\" title=\"92-df-henkin-sentence\">92-df-henkin-sentence</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"fd30fbde88ab93eb\" href=\"?note=fd30fbde88ab93eb\" title=\"92-thm-lob-theorem\">92-thm-lob-theorem</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"e0eabee5d77258a7\" href=\"?note=e0eabee5d77258a7\" title=\"92-df-g-system\">92-df-g-system</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"90f32e29c9d553ed\" href=\"?note=90f32e29c9d553ed\" title=\"92-df-sentence\">92-df-sentence</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"e9cc91aaee998c7b\" href=\"?note=e9cc91aaee998c7b\" title=\"92-df-provability-predicate\">92-df-provability-predicate</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"H\">\\(H\\)</span> (Henkin sentence, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"67317965f7ebd660\" href=\"?note=67317965f7ebd660\" title=\"92-df-henkin-sentence\">92-df-henkin-sentence</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"G\">\\(G\\)</span> (system G, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"e0eabee5d77258a7\" href=\"?note=e0eabee5d77258a7\" title=\"92-df-g-system\">92-df-g-system</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{HenkinSent}_G(H)\">\\(\\mathrm{HenkinSent}_G(H)\\)</span> (Henkin-sentence predicate)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{cor\\text{-}henkin\\text{-}provable}\\vdash\n\\forall H\\in\\mathrm{Sent}_G\\;\n\\mathrm{HenkinSent}_G(H)\\Longrightarrow G\\vdash H\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{cor\\text{-}henkin\\text{-}provable}\\vdash\n\\forall H\\in\\mathrm{Sent}_G\\;\n\\mathrm{HenkinSent}_G(H)\\Longrightarrow G\\vdash H\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>关键符号：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"H\">\\(H\\)</span> : Henkin句子，满足<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"G\\vdash H\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{Prov}_G(\\overline{\\ulcorner H\\urcorner})\">\\(G\\vdash H\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{Prov}_G(\\overline{\\ulcorner H\\urcorner})\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"G \\vdash H\">\\(G \\vdash H\\)</span> : Henkin句子在<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"G\">\\(G\\)</span>中可证</li>\n<li>这解答了Henkin的问题</li>\n<li>对本书固定的标准可证性谓词，由Löb定理及其可推导条件推出</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"H\">\\(H\\)</span>断言&quot;我可证&quot;，实际上确实可证</li>\n<li>与Gödel句子形成对比：在相应一致性等附加条件下，Gödel句不可证；Henkin句的可证性则来自Löb可导性条件</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"92-df-henkin-sentence","status":"resolved","id":"67317965f7ebd660","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[92-df-henkin-sentence]]","embed":false},{"target":"92-thm-lob-theorem","status":"resolved","id":"fd30fbde88ab93eb","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[92-thm-lob-theorem]]","embed":false},{"target":"92-df-g-system","status":"resolved","id":"e0eabee5d77258a7","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[92-df-g-system]]","embed":false},{"target":"92-df-sentence","status":"resolved","id":"90f32e29c9d553ed","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[92-df-sentence]]","embed":false},{"target":"92-df-provability-predicate","status":"resolved","id":"e9cc91aaee998c7b","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[92-df-provability-predicate]]","embed":false},{"target":"92-df-henkin-sentence","status":"resolved","id":"67317965f7ebd660","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$H$ (Henkin sentence, see [[92-df-henkin-sentence]])","embed":false},{"target":"92-df-g-system","status":"resolved","id":"e0eabee5d77258a7","anchor":"ref-7","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$G$ (system G, see [[92-df-g-system]])","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"H","display":false},{"tex":"G","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{HenkinSent}_G(H)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{cor\\text{-}henkin\\text{-}provable}\\vdash\n\\forall H\\in\\mathrm{Sent}_G\\;\n\\mathrm{HenkinSent}_G(H)\\Longrightarrow G\\vdash H","display":true},{"tex":"H","display":false},{"tex":"G\\vdash H\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{Prov}_G(\\overline{\\ulcorner H\\urcorner})","display":false},{"tex":"G \\vdash H","display":false},{"tex":"G","display":false},{"tex":"H","display":false}],"bytes":1219,"backlinks":[{"id